            "review_title": "Review at Roku & Star Bar",
            "review_text": "Marcus\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nA Wonderful Dining Experience at Roku Dining Room\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWe had a wonderful dinner at Roku Dining Room. The Japanese dishes were fresh and beautifully presented; as a lover of Japanese cuisine, I found the sashimi and sushi to be outstanding, and the grilled dishes were equally delicious, especially when paired with sake. We received excellent recommendations from the bartender, Gin, and were thoroughly impressed. The restaurant offers a pleasant atmosphere and superb service. The setting is incredibly private and romantic, allowing us to enjoy views of both the city and Ha Long Bay. A special thank you goes to Laura for taking such great care of us; she was friendly, enthusiastic, and professional, making us feel warmly welcomed and truly enhancing our dining experience. We were delighted with our time at Roku and will certainly be back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 30, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
