            "review_title": "Review at Roku & Star Bar",
            "review_text": "sabina v\nLos Angeles, California16 contributions\n0\nExceptional Food and Wonderful Service at Roku\nSep 2026 • Solo\nRoku has already become one of our absolute favorite restaurants at the InterContinental Ha Long Bay. We came for dinner last night, loved it so much that we returned again today for lunch, and we already know we’ll be back again before our stay is over. Everything we’ve tried has been exceptional, beautifully fresh sashimi and nigiri, incredible wagyu steak, delicious grilled skewers, shrimps, the Ha Long Bay soup, edamame, refreshing margaritas and desserts that were every bit as good as the rest of the meal. The quality of the ingredients, presentation and attention to detail are excellent, but what really makes Roku special are the people. Laura and Shana have been absolutely wonderful - so warm, friendly, attentive and genuinely helpful with their recommendations, and they have made every visit feel special. The restaurant itself is beautiful, with gorgeous views over Ha Long Bay, but it is the combination of fantastic food and such lovely people that keeps bringing us back. We’re still staying at the hotel and already looking forward to our next meal at Roku. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 27, 2026",
