            "review_text": "Jesse I\nHong Kong, China4 contributions\n0\nImpressive Cocktail and Japanese Cuisine\nDec 2025 • Couples\nRoku & Star Bar is a newly opened outlet at InterContinental Halong Bay Resort. Very impressed by the creative cocktails and also quality of food in the set menu. Staff are also very well trained and enthusiastic, offering us amazing experiences. Look forward to more exciting development as the restaurant grows\nInsider tip:\nCurrently no catered menu for kids yet\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 30, 2025\nChi N\nXin chao 721jessei,\n\nThank you very much for your kind and thoughtful feedback.\n\nWe are truly delighted to learn that you were impressed with your experience at Roku & Star Bar at InterContinental Halong Bay Resort. It is wonderful to hear that you enjoyed our creative cocktails, the quality of the set menu, and the attentive service provided by our team. Your recognition of our staff’s enthusiasm and professionalism means a great deal to us, as we continuously strive to deliver exceptional dining experiences.\n\nYour encouragement inspires us to keep innovating and elevating our offerings. We sincerely look forward to welcoming you back in the future.\n\nSincerely,\nJesper Bach Larsen\n\nGeneral Manager\nInterContinental Halong Bay Resort\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
